      "uri": "oe://case/item/tn-2022-bio1-ls3-4",
      "fullStatement": "Construct an explanation based on evidence that genetic variations may result from (a) new genetic combinations via the processes of crossing over and random segregation of chromosomes during meiosis, (b) mutations that occur during replication, and/or (c) mutations caused by environmental factors. Evidence should include that mutations that occur in gametes can be passed to offspring.",
